Done. The pivot is massive — the old 30s onboarding was just **Phase 1 foundation (2 weeks)**. The real game is a **12-week MMORPG** with 21 agents.

**New L role = Cinematics & Presentation** (per §9 pillar 5):
- Cinematic engine (scripted camera, dialogue, choices, locked player camera)
- **3-min intro cinematic**: arrival on Archipelago, Ancient King awakens
- **Chapter cuts**: 2-3 min between chapters, impactful choices
- **Boss intros**: 30s unique per major boss
- **World events**: server-synced cinematics (everyone sees simultaneously)
- **Replay system**: auto-record, free camera, video export

**Key dependencies** (from INBOX/L.md):
- **O (Story/Lore)** — intro script + chapter dialogues
- **V (Technical)** — camera engine, streaming for cinematics, netcode for locked camera
- **E (Concept)** — visual lore direction (Ancient King, Leviathan, Tide Curse)
- **D** — confirm letter mapping (L = Cinematics, not new agent S)
